        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-02-02T23:14:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Regarding games with missing cards, we had a really awful experience with the QC of the printer for Sentinels of the Multiverse, which is one of several reasons why we’ve switched printers for Rook City (also because we could get higher quality cardstock, etc for the cards and boxes).  If anyone is missing any cards from the core game, or has damaged cards, send me an email at <a href=\"mailto:paul@sentinelsofthemultiverse.com\">paul@sentinelsofthemultiverse.com</a> with a photo of the damaged card and I’ll send you a replacement free of charge.</p>",
